<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-779] Error creating dynamic select form in Python</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-779</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.incubator.apache.org/docs/0.6.0-incubating-SNAPSHOT/manual/dynamicform.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-428&quot; title=&quot;Support Python programmatic access to dynamic form&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-428&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-428&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; suggest that the following should render a select form:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;%pyspark
print(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Hello &quot;&lt;/span&gt;+z.select(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;day&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, [(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;mon&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;2&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;tue&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;3&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;wed&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;4&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;thurs&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;5&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;fri&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;6&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;sat&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),
                                (&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;7&quot;&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;sun&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)]))
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But instead, it yields:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Traceback (most recent call last):
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/folders/7z/smbdnf3915bcgbkgd1qfryz40000gn/T&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//zeppelin_pyspark.py&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 232, in &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;    eval(compiledCode)
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&amp;lt;string&amp;gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 7, in &amp;lt;module&amp;gt;
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;/folders/7z/smbdnf3915bcgbkgd1qfryz40000gn/T&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//zeppelin_pyspark.py&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 84, in select
&lt;/span&gt;    iterables = gateway.jvm.scala.collection.JavaConversions.collectionAsScalaIterable(tuples)
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/usr/local/opt/apache-spark/libexec/python/lib/py4j-0.9-src.zip/py4j/java_gateway.py&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 804, in __call__
    [get_command_part(arg, self.pool) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; arg in new_args])
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/usr/local/opt/apache-spark/libexec/python/lib/py4j-0.9-src.zip/py4j/java_gateway.py&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 804, in &amp;lt;listcomp&amp;gt;
    [get_command_part(arg, self.pool) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; arg in new_args])
  File &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;/usr/local/opt/apache-spark/libexec/python/lib/py4j-0.9-src.zip/py4j/protocol.py&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, line 278, in get_command_part
    command_part = REFERENCE_TYPE + parameter._get_object_id()
AttributeError: &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;map&apos;&lt;/span&gt; object has no attribute &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;_get_object_id&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve noticed this for about the past month on master and just reproduced it on a new build off d47418bb4fecc8587da8cebd70d99cf34f6eb288.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
